.SS obelisk.config.path
Project config directory (with common/, frontend/, backend/ subtrees).
Its common/ and frontend/ subtrees are bundled into the production
server as public configs; backend/ is never bundled (it may hold
secrets; supply those to the running server at runtime).
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] null or absolute path
.PP
\f[I]Default:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
null
.EE
.PP
\f[I]Example:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
\&./config
.EE
.SS obelisk.driver
The nix\-haskell driver the project is built with.
The nixpkgs driver has no wasm compiler of its own.
It reaches the wasm target only through a ghc\-wasm\-meta bindist.
